 /* == Local (static) methods =============================================== */
 
+/* ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
+/**
+ * (Re)creates the pointer observer, if the input observation manager and
+ * the seat's pointer are available. Destroys it otherwise.
+ *
+ * @param toplevel_ptr
+ *
+ * @return false on error.
+ */
